flowchart TB
    A[Supervisor-Worker fails] --> A1[Supervisor crash or worker timeout]
    A1 --> A2[Checkpoint state and add backup worker routing]

    B[Debate fails] --> B1[Biased judge or low-value argument loop]
    B1 --> B2[Add secondary judge and fallback decision path]

    C[Swarm fails] --> C1[High cost with low diversity]
    C1 --> C2[Force planner diversity and tighten merge rubric]

    D[Committee fails] --> D1[Tie paralysis or dominant member]
    D1 --> D2[Predefine tie-break rule and speaking constraints]

    E[Peer-to-Peer fails] --> E1[Negotiation never converges]
    E1 --> E2[Round limit then escalate to arbiter]